<newsitem itemid="238014" id="root" date="1996-12-05" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: Final full Hanson results show pretax rise.</title>
<headline>Final full Hanson results show pretax rise.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to October 1</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence, diluted)   25.6		   vs 18.2</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 1.0		    vs n/a</p>
<p> Pretax		     1,806		  vs 1,226</p>
<p> Turnover		   12,484		 vs 11,184</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 1.17 and 1.58 billion stg.  The results reflected the final contributions from all former Hanson Plc units before the demergers of Imperial Tobacco Group Plc and Millennium Chemicals Inc. The dividend reflects Q1 earnings from Energy, Hanson said.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
